OL,3,AAt least five dead after Amazon cargo
OL,4,Aplane speeds off runway at Miami
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least five people have been killed
OL,8,Fand five others injured after a cargo
OL,9,Fplane sped off a runway at Miami
OL,10,FInternational Airport
OL,12,FThe Amazon Air cargo plane overshot the
OL,13,Frunway after landing at about 14:00
OL,14,Flocal time (19:00 BST) and left the
OL,15,Frunway at nearly 130mph (209kmh) - see
OL,16,Fthe path of the plane
OL,18,FThe Boeing 767-300 hit multiple
OL,19,Fvehicles, caught fire, and came to a
OL,20,Frest tipped forward onto its nose - 200
OL,21,Ffirefighters responded the initial
OL,22,Fcrash reports
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
